    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353e53619cff12692fcf22f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其对赛马娘精神层面的照顾更是无微不至。\n他不会拘泥于指导手册与常规，\n而是配合赛马娘的状态灵活地做出应对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb856a162472fb9ed7de8e3feb20e648f29a8162333ccd723690099a68a21a09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
